[00:00.000]...
[00:27.521]Wouldn't it be nice to take a walk on some pure white sand
{"漫步在纯白沙滩上该有多美好"}
[00:34.270]Gaze at the horizon
{"凝望地平线"}
[00:37.751]Without living in fear?
{"不再活在恐惧中？"}
[00:40.950]Wouldn't it be sweet to watch the sun curve
{"看着太阳划出弧线该有多甜蜜"}
[00:44.977]Down meet the waves?
{"与海浪相会？"}
[00:48.199]And taste the ocean spray
{"品尝海风的咸涩"}
[00:51.597]And realize we've been living as slaves
{"才意识到我们一直活得像个奴隶"}
[00:59.469]We've got to learn to get back, get back
{"我们必须学会回归 回归本真"}
[01:02.813]But is it worth the price of our soul?
{"但值得以灵魂为代价吗？"}
[01:06.157]You know you had to kill her, kill her!
{"你知道你不得不杀了她 杀了她！"}
[01:09.920]Oh my dirty hands
{"哦 我这双肮脏的手"}
[01:11.848]It never fades
{"永远洗不净"}
[01:13.290]And if we get out, get out
{"如果我们能逃脱 逃脱"}
[01:16.151]I'll think about the price of our soul
{"我会思考灵魂的代价"}
[01:19.471]We've got to learn to live free, live free
{"我们必须学会自由地活 自由地活"}
[01:22.808]We'll live a life without barricades
{"我们将过上毫无阻碍的生活"}
[01:27.219]Woah! Woah! Woah! Woah!
[01:54.257]...
[02:17.102]How long I haven't seen the light shine through in my life?
{"多久没见到生命中的光芒了？"}
[02:21.809]Lost everything
{"失去一切"}
[02:22.932]Family, confusion on the way
{"家人 前路充满迷茫"}
[02:26.171]Someone tries to talk to me
{"有人试图与我对话"}
[02:27.989]And signpost the righteous road
{"为我指明正义之路"}
[02:31.118]My animal inside
{"我内心的兽性"}
[02:33.438]Can now be tamed to go over the wall
{"终能被驯服 翻越高墙"}
[02:38.808]We've got to learn to get back, get back
{"我们必须学会回归 回归本真"}
[02:41.270]But is it worth the price of our soul?
{"但这是否值得我们付出灵魂的代价？"}
[02:43.381]You know you had to kill her, kill her!
{"你知道你必须杀了她，杀了她！"}
[02:46.068]Oh my dirty hands it never fades and if we get out, get out
{"噢 我肮脏的双手永不褪色 如果我们能逃脱 逃脱"}
[02:50.318]I'll think about the price of our soul
{"我会思考我们灵魂的代价"}
[02:52.670]We've got to learn to live free, live free
{"我们必须学会自由地生活 自由地生活"}
[02:54.859]We'll live a life without barricades
{"我们将过上毫无阻碍的生活"}
[02:57.709]Woah! Woah! Woah! Woah!
